  "coverage_note": "This is what the swatch site currently lists. Earlier ST ranges were wider — Field’s catalogues from 2003–2010 print ST colours under 45\" numbers that were later restyled to 58\" ones — and none of that history is here; see research/FINDINGS.md for what is known of it.",
